## Fixed Module Order

The 15 modules must be implemented in this order (dependencies require it):

1. **01-auth-and-session** — Supabase Auth + JWT + session state
2. **02-household-multi-tenancy** — Household creation, member invite, RLS tenant isolation
3. **03-categories** — Expense/income categories (personal + shared in household)
4. **04-fixed-bills** — Recurring monthly bills
5. **05-expenses** — One-off expenses + attachments
6. **06-income** — Salary and variable income
7. **07-goals-and-events** — Savings goals, life events (car, vacation)
8. **08-dashboard** — Overview card, quick stats, trends
9. **09-widgets-and-customization** — Dashboard widget selection and reorder
10. **10-filters-and-reports** — Date range filters, category drill-down, P&L export
11. **11-notifications-and-alerts** — Bill due alerts, goal milestone, anomaly flags
12. **12-configurations** — App settings (theme, language, notifications, privacy)
13. **13-mobile-responsive** — Optimize for phone (buttons, layouts, touch)
14. **14-export-and-ical** — PDF export, iCal sync for calendars
15. **15-security-and-compliance** — Final security audit, GDPR compliance, secrets rotation

**Do not skip or reorder** without explicit risk assessment.

