## Acceptance Criteria Format

All criteria must be in **Gherkin** (Given/When/Then):

```gherkin
Scenario: User creates a fixed bill with valid data
  Given I am logged in as a household owner
  And I am on the Fixed Bills create page
  When I fill "name" with "Internet"
  And I fill "value" with "99.90"
  And I fill "due_day" with "10"
  And I select category "Utilities"
  And I click "Create Bill"
  Then the page shows "Bill created successfully"
  And the bill appears in my bill list
  And a PostgreSQL trigger has logged the value in bill_value_history
```

**Why Gherkin?**:
- Clear, executable specification
- Non-technical stakeholders can read it
- Maps directly to E2E test code
- Traceability to business rules

